{"3789050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The INDIGO Initiative", "steam_appid": 3789050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the unknown as you explore fractured dimensions on the brink of collapse. Harness elemental powers using cutting-edge technology to navigate the multiverse and seal tears in an effort to undo the Cataclysm threatening all of humanity. Every dimension hides secrets. Each puzzle unravels another layer of the mystery behind the INDIGO Initiative and the shadowy corporation pulling the strings. Can you mend what was never meant to be broken?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The INDIGO Initiative</strong> is a first-person, narrative-driven puzzle adventure. You are Dr. Kepler, a scientist within the Initiative. With help from your AI assistant AVA, you must uncover the truth, restore order, and survive the consequences of human ambition unleashed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Focused Exploration:</strong> Traverse the multiverse by solving multi-step environmental puzzles using fire, water, electricity, and magnetism. Many offering multiple solutions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789050/extras/55cfb1679787b27766f7c4c9ddd7743d.poster.avif?t=1754093424\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789050/extras/55cfb1679787b27766f7c4c9ddd7743d.webm?t=1754093424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789050/extras/55cfb1679787b27766f7c4c9ddd7743d.mp4?t=1754093424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Manipulation:</strong> Experiment and improvise as you combine and unleash elemental forces with advanced prototypes. Adapt your approach to overcome a variety of obstacles with multiple solutions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789050/extras/674573691a073ffeb6dc5362f732c9e3.poster.avif?t=1754093424\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789050/extras/674573691a073ffeb6dc5362f732c9e3.webm?t=1754093424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789050/extras/674573691a073ffeb6dc5362f732c9e3.mp4?t=1754093424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vivid, Atmospheric Realms:</strong> Journey through striking locations, from a forgotten temple to a remote, treacherous island - each brimming with secrets to uncover and challenges to overcome. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789050/extras/893a672f3967b2a729890812c4a04855.poster.avif?t=1754093424\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789050/extras/893a672f3967b2a729890812c4a04855.webm?t=1754093424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789050/extras/893a672f3967b2a729890812c4a04855.mp4?t=1754093424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Mystery:</strong> Piece together Dr Kepler’s lost memories and the fate of a shattered universe through environmental storytelling and conversations with your enigmatic AI companion.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789050/extras/8d2afc3cc5a5bb6e93d4ef056443d934.poster.avif?t=1754093424\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789050/extras/8d2afc3cc5a5bb6e93d4ef056443d934.webm?t=1754093424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789050/extras/8d2afc3cc5a5bb6e93d4ef056443d934.mp4?t=1754093424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to uncover the secrets behind the Cataclysm? Reality depends on you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the unknown as you explore fractured dimensions on the brink of collapse. Harness elemental powers using cutting-edge technology to navigate the multiverse and seal tears in an effort to undo the Cataclysm threatening all of humanity. Every dimension hides secrets. Each puzzle unravels another layer of the mystery behind the INDIGO Initiative and the shadowy corporation pulling the strings. Can you mend what was never meant to be broken?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The INDIGO Initiative</strong> is a first-person, narrative-driven puzzle adventure. You are Dr. Kepler, a scientist within the Initiative. With help from your AI assistant AVA, you must uncover the truth, restore order, and survive the consequences of human ambition unleashed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Focused Exploration:</strong> Traverse the multiverse by solving multi-step environmental puzzles using fire, water, electricity, and magnetism. Many offering multiple solutions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.aka